{:strongs 1481, :hebrew "יגור", :lang :zh-Hans, :gloss "properly, to turn aside from the road (for a lodging or any other purpose), i.e. sojourn (as a guest); also to shrink, fear (as in a strange place); also to gather for hostility (as afraid)", :text "本义:从路上转离 (为寄宿或其他目的),即寄居 (作为客旅);也指畏缩、畏惧 (如在陌生之地);也指因恐惧而聚集 (表现出敌意)", :model "glm-5.2", :timestamp "2026-07-27T02:04:55.353904717Z"}